With `core.auto_migrate: false` in the global tier a behind vault gets today's STOP notice on
`booping render` — addressed to the user, not an order to migrate unattended — and still exits 0.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  auto_migrate: false
-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
-- fixtures/cwd/probe.md.j2 --
rendered body
-- cmd --
booping render /proc/self/cwd/probe.md.j2
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
**STOP — tell the user:** this project is behind on booping migrations (recorded id -1, latest shipped [..]). Run `/playbook migrate` to bring the vault current, then retry.
-- stderr --
